          "field": "summary",
          "value": "- The 2nd installment of the original \"Touch Adventure\"!!\n- The controls are simple...investigate suspicious items and people with a single touch!!\n- The items and testimonies you collect are the keys to the mystery...apply your deductive skills and intuition to tough(?) cases!\n- 5 completely new episodes!!\n- Loaded with bonus scenarios, too!",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
